{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみだで。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/25/0225761/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もお稽古でした( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉにこにこ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり歌う事は楽しいね(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人前でパフォーマンスするの好きだな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/25/0225761/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様に早く舞台お観せしたいのだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、期待してて良いよ？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんやかんやゆうてる間に夏休みも終盤に近づいてきただねぇ......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つまり今の能條は、宿題という悪魔のラストスパートにかかっておる ( ◞˟૩˟)◞"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日もお家に帰ってから頑張ったもんでただいま睡眠に飢えておる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今あみ好きなだけ寝て良いよって言われたら、2日間くらい眠り続けられる自信ある(^O^)／笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう、明日は何の日かわかってるかい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/25/0225761/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は、イオンモールむさし村山にてミニ握手会あるだよみんな❤❤❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","t