agraph","text":"あの頃は若かった。え"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみの好きな女の子のタイプは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.愛嬌があって、あみのおふざけに一緒にのってくれる子！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.男性、女性それぞれの好きなファッションは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.男性も女性も、こういうのっていうのはないの！爽やかで清潔感あって、似合ってればそれでよしっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.脱水症状もどきってどんなん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.からっからになって意識が遠のいた事が......。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんじゃ明日来れるあみあみ族のみんな明日ね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/25/0225761/0004.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}